{"uid":"thag2.15","title":"Sabbamitta","reference":"Theragāthā 2.15","blocks":[{"kind":"verse","lines":["People are attached to people;","people depend on people;","people are hurt by people;","and people hurt people.","So what’s the point of people,","or those born of people?","Go, abandon these people,","who’ve hurt so many people."]}]}
